  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> wrist; <strong>Price</strong> 72,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 4 lbs.</p>\n<p>This gold bracelet grants its wearer the Friendship aegis, which allows all of their allies to exclude them from many sphere effects and supernatural abilities that affect an area. Casters often give this bracelet to their warrior friends, allowing them to cast their most destructive attacks with no fear of hitting their beefy barrier.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Protection sphere (Friendship (aegis)); <strong>Cost</strong> 36,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
